WEBVTT

00:08:28.913 --> 00:08:31.871
generous givers who are willing
to put the team or

00:08:31.871 --> 00:08:33.496
the organization above themselves.

00:08:33.746 --> 00:08:36.537
And it seems like you see a similar
dynamic with chimps.

00:08:37.829 --> 00:08:42.454
Yes, and of course, chimps don't
have leadership in quite

00:08:42.454 --> 00:08:46.454
the way of what you will
study in humans because

00:08:46.454 --> 00:08:52.162
I guess that are studying leaders in
politics or business or both. Exactly.

00:08:52.662 --> 00:08:55.621
Yes. And for chimpanzees, you know,

00:08:55.621 --> 00:08:59.912
it's the strive for some of the
males is the alpha position.

00:08:59.954 --> 00:09:01.871
They want to dominate the others.